WEBVTT

1

00:00:18.125 --> 00:00:22.583

Falco? Where are you headed this late?



2

00:00:22.583 --> 00:00:27.083

I forgot something at HQ,

so I'm going back to get it.



3

00:00:27.083 --> 00:00:28.750

See you later!



4

00:00:34.042 --> 00:00:37.417

Falco, could you do me a favor?



5

00:00:37.417 --> 00:00:40.708

What's that, Mr. Kruger?



6

00:00:40.708 --> 00:00:43.333

I want to send a letter, but...



7

00:00:43.333 --> 00:00:47.083

...if it's sent from the internment zone,

they'll check it.



8

00:00:47.083 --> 00:00:48.542

That's right.



9

00:00:48.542 --> 00:00:54.833

They might find out I'm not really sick,

so could you send it from outside?



10

00:00:54.833 --> 00:00:58.333

Sure thing. Is it to your family?



11

00:00:58.333 --> 00:01:03.875

Yeah. I wanna tell 'em I'm here

and doing just fine.



12

00:02:38.958 --> 00:02:44.000

"From One Hand to Another"



13

00:02:49.042 --> 00:02:51.125

Hey, why all the commotion?



14

00:02:51.125 --> 00:02:54.167

The whole Tybur family has come to visit!



15

00:02:54.167 --> 00:02:56.000

Excuse me?



16

00:02:59.833 --> 00:03:05.958

It's the Tyburs' personal guard.

They're not part of our military.



17

00:03:05.958 --> 00:03:07.500

Come in.



18

00:03:08.542 --> 00:03:14.250

Sorry to drop in on you.

I'm Willy, the head of the Tybur family.



19

00:03:14.250 --> 00:03:17.542

Commander of the Warrior unit, Theo Magath.



20

00:03:17.542 --> 00:03:21.125

It's an honor to meet you, Lord Tybur.



21

00:03:21.125 --> 00:03:28.292

Nice to meet you, Commander Magath.

Allow me to introduce you to the family.



22

00:03:34.208 --> 00:03:37.708

Having managed the Warrior unit

from the outset,



23

00:03:37.708 --> 00:03:42.417

are you able to tell which of us

is the War Hammer Titan?



24

00:03:42.417 --> 00:03:49.792

No, I haven't a clue.

One might wonder if it's even here at all.



25

00:03:49.792 --> 00:03:53.125

You're very astute, just like I've heard.



26

00:03:53.125 --> 00:03:55.500

But it's here.



27

00:03:55.500 --> 00:03:59.542

The War Hammer Titan is among us.



28

00:04:05.083 --> 00:04:08.750

I came here to see the statue of Helos.



29

00:04:08.750 --> 00:04:13.042

A century ago, a mere human

slayed the devil of all earth



30

00:04:13.042 --> 00:04:18.875

and became the renowned Marleyan

hero who saved the world--Helos.



31

00:04:18.875 --> 00:04:24.292

How marvelous. So brave and

beautiful, with not a scratch.



32

00:04:24.292 --> 00:04:27.500

Truly, the spirit of Marley.



33

00:04:27.500 --> 00:04:33.458

The spirit, indeed.

For within, it's empty inside.



34

00:04:33.458 --> 00:04:36.500

You're a tough critic, Commander.



35

00:04:36.500 --> 00:04:40.875

I hear you're working to reinstate

Marleyan conscription?



36

00:04:40.875 --> 00:04:45.833

War, for Marleyans,

exists solely inside their newspapers.



37

00:04:45.833 --> 00:04:50.250

They're content to just read

about our lands expanding.



38

00:04:50.250 --> 00:04:57.000

If our tamed devils or conquered armies

are eating the bullets, all the better.



39

00:04:57.000 --> 00:05:02.000

One hopes letting Marleyans hear the

sound of bullets whizzing by their ears



40

00:05:02.000 --> 00:05:07.375

will be enough to stop our

self-destructive march towards war.



41

00:05:10.417 --> 00:05:14.583

If someone controlled Marley

from the shadows, I'd tell them:



42

00:05:14.583 --> 00:05:18.208

It's already too late.



43

00:05:18.208 --> 00:05:23.083

You truly don't hold back,

Commander. What can I say?



44

00:05:23.083 --> 00:05:27.958

As you noted, this nation is

controlled by the Tyburs.



45

00:05:27.958 --> 00:05:34.042

But this path of warmongering

was one that Marley chose on its own.



46

00:05:34.042 --> 00:05:39.292

We gave Marley both freedom

and power in hopes of atonement.



47

00:05:39.292 --> 00:05:43.208

But in the end, Eldia and Marley

were thrown into darkness.



48

00:05:43.208 --> 00:05:46.250

The Tyburs are responsible for that.



49

00:05:46.250 --> 00:05:51.750

I intend to reveal the truth to the world

at the upcoming festival.



50

00:05:51.750 --> 00:05:58.542

My coming to see the statue was no lie.

Marley is in need of a hero once more.



51

00:05:58.542 --> 00:06:04.208

Theo Magath... Will you not join hands with me?



52

00:06:12.917 --> 00:06:14.125

Huh?



53

00:06:14.125 --> 00:06:16.333

Morning, Pock!



54

00:06:17.625 --> 00:06:20.208

Pieck! What are you doing?!



55

00:06:20.208 --> 00:06:25.417

This way's more natural to me. Did I scare you?



56

00:06:25.417 --> 00:06:28.917

Can you just walk upright?



57

00:06:28.917 --> 00:06:31.250

Titans come from the south.



58

00:06:31.250 --> 00:06:36.542

The wall will be less defended the closer

you get to these mountains up north.



59

00:06:36.542 --> 00:06:39.208

Then, we should attack from the north?



60

00:06:39.208 --> 00:06:41.125

That's one option.



61

00:06:41.125 --> 00:06:46.875

However, the wharf is the only place

where our large ships can dock.



62

00:06:46.875 --> 00:06:48.833

We could press our advantage.



63

00:06:48.833 --> 00:06:50.792

So, the south?



64

00:06:50.792 --> 00:06:54.542

But the south is where

our scout ships were lost.



65

00:06:54.542 --> 00:06:59.500

It's where they're most focused.

The wharf might even be destroyed.



66

00:06:59.500 --> 00:07:02.125

So, what are you trying to say?



67

00:07:02.125 --> 00:07:05.875

I'm merely trying to share

the information I gathered.



68

00:07:05.875 --> 00:07:11.750

All right, enough.

It was dumb to let an Eldian talk.



69

00:07:15.667 --> 00:07:18.958

The Paradis Island planning is going just swell.



70

00:07:18.958 --> 00:07:22.708

The brass in charge is oh so intelligent.



71

00:07:22.708 --> 00:07:25.833

Can't wait to hear what they come up with.



72

00:07:25.833 --> 00:07:31.167

Like entrusting the whole thing to four kids?



73

00:07:32.125 --> 00:07:33.333

Hmm?



74

00:07:37.458 --> 00:07:41.500

He's ahead. Falco passed up Gabi!



75

00:07:45.875 --> 00:07:51.625

Look at 'em celebrate one little win.

Jeez. They've got no idea.



76

00:07:51.625 --> 00:07:58.375

No matter how well Falco does

at this point, he'll never surpass Gabi.



77

00:07:58.375 --> 00:08:00.958

Did you see him take off at the end?!



78

00:08:00.958 --> 00:08:03.833

Hey, runts. What's the big deal?



79

00:08:03.833 --> 00:08:06.208

Falco finally beat Gabi!



80

00:08:06.208 --> 00:08:08.167

In grades?! Really?!



81

00:08:08.167 --> 00:08:10.667

No, just in a race!



82

00:08:10.667 --> 00:08:12.875

This is a historic feat!



83

00:08:12.875 --> 00:08:16.208

Can you cut it out? You're embarrassing me.



84

00:08:16.208 --> 00:08:20.792

That's pretty awesome!

Maybe you'll be the next Armor!



85

00:08:20.792 --> 00:08:22.792

Ow!



86

00:08:22.792 --> 00:08:26.208

It's way too late to compete against me!



87

00:08:26.208 --> 00:08:30.875

I made our motherland proud in the war!



88

00:08:30.875 --> 00:08:33.083

I know.



89

00:08:33.083 --> 00:08:37.042

But they still haven't announced

a successor yet.



90

00:08:37.042 --> 00:08:41.167

Until then, I'll do everything I can.



91

00:08:42.458 --> 00:08:46.292

Man, talk about showing off.



92

00:08:46.292 --> 00:08:51.583

Your brother's already inheriting the Beast!

You'll be an Honorary Marleyan!



93

00:08:51.583 --> 00:08:54.500

What's the point of trying so hard?!



94

00:08:59.125 --> 00:09:01.833

I'm doing it for you!



95

00:09:01.833 --> 00:09:02.917

Whoa...



96

00:09:02.917 --> 00:09:05.542

He totally said it!



97

00:09:08.250 --> 00:09:13.625

Huh?! You're getting in my way,

but you're doing it for me?



98

00:09:13.625 --> 00:09:16.875

That doesn't make any damn sense!



99

00:09:16.875 --> 00:09:19.208

Guess it didn't get through.



100

00:09:19.208 --> 00:09:22.958

Huh?! What's his problem?! What gives?!



101

00:09:24.167 --> 00:09:27.625

Oh! Welcome back, our little Warriors!



102

00:09:27.625 --> 00:09:35.875

Gabi! I heard what you did, Gabi!

You're our savior, Gabi!



103

00:09:35.875 --> 00:09:38.417

Well, I'm Zofia, so...



104

00:09:38.417 --> 00:09:39.250

Huh?



105

00:09:39.250 --> 00:09:44.958

What's wrong with you?! Quit day drinking

and grabbing girls, you geezer!



106

00:09:44.958 --> 00:09:49.583

Shuddap, you nincompoop!

What's wrong with praising a hero?!



107

00:09:49.583 --> 00:09:53.000

If anything, being praised by you is bad luck!



108

00:09:53.000 --> 00:09:57.583

Go on! Stumble back home to your mom!



109

00:09:57.583 --> 00:10:00.958

Now then, I've got a treat for you kids!



110

00:10:00.958 --> 00:10:05.625

Eat up and grow big like Vice Chief Braun!



111

00:10:05.625 --> 00:10:07.708

Thank you!



112

00:10:10.500 --> 00:10:12.625

Whoa!



113

00:10:12.625 --> 00:10:16.667

Will they really declare war

right here in the zone?



114

00:10:16.667 --> 00:10:19.667

Reminds me of a theater.



115

00:10:19.667 --> 00:10:22.458

I heard they're inviting VIPs here



116

00:10:22.458 --> 00:10:27.875

and after doing this festival,

the world will be on our side.



117

00:10:27.875 --> 00:10:30.208

Fantastic!



118

00:10:30.208 --> 00:10:34.083

All of Marley's problems will magically go away!



119

00:10:34.083 --> 00:10:36.208

You think it won't work?



120

00:10:36.208 --> 00:10:38.250

You actually do?



121

00:10:38.250 --> 00:10:43.250

The Mid-East Forces we were

just slaughtering will be there.



122

00:10:43.250 --> 00:10:50.167

My family came from an internment zone

abroad, so I know how awful it is.



123

00:10:50.167 --> 00:10:54.125

The hate for Eldians abroad

makes here seem like nothing.



124

00:10:54.125 --> 00:10:58.375

Well, all the more reason

we've gotta try something.



125

00:10:58.375 --> 00:11:02.792

They might've chosen to hold it here

so people understand us!



126

00:11:02.792 --> 00:11:05.917

We can show 'em we're not devils!



127

00:11:05.917 --> 00:11:07.458

But how?



128

00:11:07.458 --> 00:11:08.667

Smile!



129

00:11:08.667 --> 00:11:14.583

I know you can't wait to show the world

they're wrong, but stop looking so smug.



130

00:11:14.583 --> 00:11:18.167

And, Zofia... Cut it out with your weird act.



131

00:11:18.167 --> 00:11:20.625

Um, this is who I am...



132

00:11:20.625 --> 00:11:23.750

Fine! So what are you gonna fix?!



133

00:11:23.750 --> 00:11:28.125

Huh? There's no need, 'cuz I'm perfect as-is!



134

00:11:28.125 --> 00:11:30.583

I'm smart and cute as a button!



135

00:11:30.583 --> 00:11:36.000

And when I captivate all the VIPs,

it'll secure my spot even more!



136

00:11:36.000 --> 00:11:38.667

I think I spot a devil.



137

00:11:38.667 --> 00:11:42.792

If you guys cheer for Falco again,

I'll make you cry!



138

00:11:42.792 --> 00:11:45.208

You really are a devil!



139

00:11:46.208 --> 00:11:48.583

It's Commander Magath.



140

00:11:48.583 --> 00:11:50.125

Here.



141

00:11:54.250 --> 00:11:58.958

Oh? A large-scale demolition is required?



142

00:11:58.958 --> 00:12:02.167

It has decayed beyond repair.



143

00:12:05.375 --> 00:12:09.542

Congratulations, General. The military is yours.



144

00:12:09.542 --> 00:12:18.250

No. The military serves the nation,

and this nation's supreme commander is you.



145

00:12:18.250 --> 00:12:23.708

That's not quite true.

I'm simply the one who holds the wheel.



146

00:12:23.708 --> 00:12:28.833

Now I know why my

predecessors never tried to grab it.



147

00:12:28.833 --> 00:12:31.583

It's so heavy.



148

00:12:31.583 --> 00:12:38.542

I wish I could let go this very moment,

but a time has come where I must not.



149

00:12:38.542 --> 00:12:41.042

It just happened to be me.



150

00:12:41.042 --> 00:12:45.708

I'm simply the man

this responsibility fell upon.



151

00:12:45.708 --> 00:12:51.458

The house was in danger of collapsing,

but some pillars remained usable.



152

00:12:51.458 --> 00:12:57.333

According to them, the house

is already infested with rats.



153

00:12:58.375 --> 00:13:00.458

Nice work, Falco.



154

00:13:00.458 --> 00:13:03.042

It's all thanks to you, Kruger!



155

00:13:03.042 --> 00:13:07.833

But at this point, I honestly doubt

I can pass up Gabi.



156

00:13:07.833 --> 00:13:11.542

Even so, I'm gonna keep moving forward.



157

00:13:11.542 --> 00:13:16.375

I see. I'm the one who should be

thanking you, though.



158

00:13:16.375 --> 00:13:23.042

I'm grateful you've been sending

all my letters. You've been a big help.



159

00:13:23.042 --> 00:13:25.583

Yeah...



160

00:13:25.583 --> 00:13:29.125

Did your family send you that?



161

00:13:29.125 --> 00:13:33.000

They thought it'd make

hospital life less boring.



162

00:13:33.000 --> 00:13:36.417

Hard to do much in this shape, though.



163

00:13:36.417 --> 00:13:38.958

I need to move forward, too.



164

00:13:38.958 --> 00:13:43.292

When the festival's over,

I'm going back to my hometown.



165

00:13:44.250 --> 00:13:46.292

I see.



166

00:13:47.375 --> 00:13:49.417

A doctor's coming.



167

00:13:49.417 --> 00:13:51.125

I'll get going!



168

00:13:51.125 --> 00:13:52.458

Yeah.



169

00:13:54.292 --> 00:13:56.917

May I sit next to you?



170

00:13:56.917 --> 00:13:59.500

Yeah, sure.



171

00:13:59.500 --> 00:14:02.000

I appreciate it.



172

00:14:04.583 --> 00:14:11.333

I'm Jaeger, a physician for the zone.

I come here to drink tea sometimes.



173

00:14:11.333 --> 00:14:14.708

Nice to meet you. I'm Kruger.



174

00:14:14.708 --> 00:14:20.708

Nice to meet you, Kruger.

You seem to get along with that boy.



175

00:14:20.708 --> 00:14:21.500

Yeah.



176

00:14:21.500 --> 00:14:25.708

I see. I think I could get along with him, too.



177

00:14:25.708 --> 00:14:31.250

I sit here on this bench looking

for people to talk to.



178

00:14:31.250 --> 00:14:36.167

His uncle was a leader of

the Eldian Restorationists.



179

00:14:36.167 --> 00:14:41.958

Restorationists are sent to paradise

and not even their family is spared.



180

00:14:41.958 --> 00:14:47.000

To protect their family,

he and his brother trained to be Warriors,



181

00:14:47.000 --> 00:14:51.625

and when his brother was chosen

to inherit the Beast Titan,



182

00:14:51.625 --> 00:14:56.417

the Grice family knew they were finally safe.



183

00:14:56.417 --> 00:15:00.458

Why are you telling me this?



184

00:15:00.458 --> 00:15:04.292

Stop asking the boy to do favors for you.



185

00:15:04.292 --> 00:15:10.208

If he comes under suspicion, all their

effort will have been for nothing.



186

00:15:10.208 --> 00:15:15.917

And if you're truly healthy,

you should go back to your family.



187

00:15:15.917 --> 00:15:23.417

Someday, you won't see them anymore.

Don't wait and live with regret.



188

00:15:23.417 --> 00:15:26.333

Regret, huh?



189

00:15:29.333 --> 00:15:33.292

You have regrets about your own family?



190

00:15:35.083 --> 00:15:38.042

There's not a day that I don't.



191

00:15:38.042 --> 00:15:42.542

That day, my son took

my daughter outside the walls.



192

00:15:42.542 --> 00:15:48.375

It's because I was too strict

about him becoming a doctor!



193

00:15:50.667 --> 00:15:55.083

It's my fault! Everything was my fault!



194

00:15:59.000 --> 00:16:03.042

Mr. Jaeger! Please don't go around on your own!



195

00:16:03.042 --> 00:16:07.292

I'm so sorry. I looked away for a second.



196

00:16:07.292 --> 00:16:09.542

This way, Mr. Jaeger.



197

00:16:09.542 --> 00:16:11.917

Everything will be okay.



198

00:16:18.917 --> 00:16:23.917

"The Tybur Family joined hands with the Marleyan

hero Helos to overcome the Eldian Empire

and bring an end to the Great Titan War.

They have long possessed the War Hammer Titan."



199

00:16:30.375 --> 00:16:31.625

Whoa!



200

00:16:31.625 --> 00:16:33.875

I've seen them in the paper!



201

00:16:33.875 --> 00:16:38.750

Cut the chitchat.

We've gotta be waiters like we trained.



202

00:16:38.750 --> 00:16:42.000

Look, there's empty glasses! Get 'em!



203

00:16:50.708 --> 00:16:52.708

--Falco, drink!

--Here!



204

00:16:54.417 --> 00:16:59.000

Hmm? Oh... There's filthy blood

touching the plates.



205

00:16:59.000 --> 00:17:02.500

Ugh! That explains why the food stinks!



206

00:17:07.292 --> 00:17:09.375

I-I'm terribly sorry!



207

00:17:09.375 --> 00:17:11.583

Shh! Don't make a fuss.



208

00:17:11.583 --> 00:17:14.583

B-But your fancy clothes--!



209

00:17:14.583 --> 00:17:17.875

Is everything all right, madam?



210

00:17:17.875 --> 00:17:19.708

How embarrassing!



211

00:17:19.708 --> 00:17:24.250

I spilled wine on my kimono

and was asking for help!



212

00:17:24.250 --> 00:17:25.417

Thank you.



213

00:17:25.417 --> 00:17:28.917

I'm sorry to hear that.

Please, come this way.



214

00:17:28.917 --> 00:17:31.333

Wh-Why?



215

00:17:31.333 --> 00:17:34.917

Who knows what would've happened to you.



216

00:17:35.875 --> 00:17:37.333

You okay?



217

00:17:37.333 --> 00:17:40.792

Yeah... She saved me.



218

00:17:40.792 --> 00:17:44.042

She knew I was an Eldian.



219

00:17:44.042 --> 00:17:49.375

That woman... I think she's

an Easterner from Hizuru.



220

00:17:53.292 --> 00:17:54.792

It's Willy!



221

00:17:55.958 --> 00:18:00.000

Willy! Kin of our saviors!



222

00:18:00.000 --> 00:18:03.333

Ambassador Ogweno! Long time no see!



223

00:18:03.333 --> 00:18:06.417

Nambia! We were kids last time I saw you!



224

00:18:06.417 --> 00:18:09.833

I used to make you cry all the time!



225

00:18:09.833 --> 00:18:11.917

Remember this, Willy?



226

00:18:11.917 --> 00:18:15.708

Oh! From the time you fell out of the tree!



227

00:18:20.542 --> 00:18:26.542

Ladies and Gentlemen!

We thank you all for coming tonight!



228

00:18:26.542 --> 00:18:32.958

Until recently, we were squabbling

over resources in an unsightly war.



229

00:18:32.958 --> 00:18:37.500

However, yesterday's enemy is today's enemy!



230

00:18:37.500 --> 00:18:41.833

Pardon me. Yesterday's enemy is today's friend!



231

00:18:41.833 --> 00:18:45.958

Let's wash the past

down the toilet with our drinks!



232

00:18:45.958 --> 00:18:49.667

Please raise your glasses

and join me for a toast!



233

00:18:49.667 --> 00:18:53.083

To everlasting peace!



234

00:18:55.167 --> 00:19:00.125

Thank you very much! Such an elegant

joke to amuse our guests!



235

00:19:00.125 --> 00:19:02.375

--Huh?

--But I'm afraid our guests



236

00:19:02.375 --> 00:19:06.792

didn't quite understand,

so allow me to take over.



237

00:19:06.792 --> 00:19:08.167

Yeah, Willy!



238

00:19:08.167 --> 00:19:10.500

Kin of our saviors!



239

00:19:13.958 --> 00:19:19.833

Tomorrow, I invite all of you

to the Liberio Internment Zone.



240

00:19:19.833 --> 00:19:24.375

It is the home of a people

whose blood runs through me.



241

00:19:24.375 --> 00:19:31.083

The ones called devils for slaughtering

a great number of people--the Eldians.



242

00:19:31.083 --> 00:19:34.333

Though once repressed more greatly than any,



243

00:19:34.333 --> 00:19:40.083

Marley has used the devils to oppress

other nations and repeat the tragedy.



244

00:19:40.083 --> 00:19:44.458

I understand the desire

to exterminate the Eldians.



245

00:19:44.458 --> 00:19:51.042

But I have arrived at a single solution

that will answer this endless problem.



246

00:19:51.042 --> 00:19:58.375

Tomorrow, I will reveal that solution

in my first-ever theater production.



247

00:19:58.375 --> 00:20:02.250

To the great playwrights

and witnesses of history!



248

00:20:02.250 --> 00:20:05.542

To the playwrights and witnesses of history!



249

00:20:19.875 --> 00:20:21.167

What the--?!



250

00:20:33.375 --> 00:20:35.042

What in the world?!



251

00:20:35.042 --> 00:20:37.667

Gabi! You're finally up!



252

00:20:37.667 --> 00:20:39.125

What's happening?!



253

00:20:39.125 --> 00:20:40.458

The festival!



254

00:20:40.458 --> 00:20:45.417

People from outside came pouring in

and opened all these stalls!



255

00:20:45.417 --> 00:20:46.792

Try this!



256

00:20:47.792 --> 00:20:49.750

<i>This </i>is a festival?!



257

00:20:49.750 --> 00:20:51.250

Let's go!



258

00:21:18.333 --> 00:21:21.042

It hurts!



259

00:21:21.042 --> 00:21:24.458

'Cuz you stuffed your face.



260

00:21:24.458 --> 00:21:29.042

I wish we had festivals every day! Blech!



261

00:21:29.042 --> 00:21:30.375

Yeah.



262

00:21:30.375 --> 00:21:35.583

Lately, it seems like lots of new

things have been happening.



263

00:21:35.583 --> 00:21:37.333

It does.



264

00:21:37.333 --> 00:21:42.667

It kinda feels like something

is about to change!



265

00:21:42.667 --> 00:21:44.625

Yeah.



266

00:21:44.625 --> 00:21:46.250

It does.



267

00:22:50.708 --> 00:22:53.500

Oh? Did you guys have fun?



268

00:22:53.500 --> 00:22:56.500

Huh? Where's Falco?



269

00:22:56.500 --> 00:22:59.625

He said he saw someone he knew and ran off.



270

00:22:59.625 --> 00:23:03.167

Really? What's the matter with him?



271

00:23:03.167 --> 00:23:05.875

Can't you just loosen up for a day?



272

00:23:05.875 --> 00:23:07.542

So many people...



273

00:23:07.542 --> 00:23:10.042

Huh? Looks like he's back.



274

00:23:10.042 --> 00:23:12.083

Mr. Braun!



275

00:23:12.083 --> 00:23:14.792

Where the hell did you go?



276

00:23:14.792 --> 00:23:16.583

Can you come with me?



277

00:23:16.583 --> 00:23:17.917

Right now?



278

00:23:17.917 --> 00:23:22.583

You'll be fine. It shouldn't start for a bit.



279

00:23:22.583 --> 00:23:24.042

This way!



280

00:23:24.042 --> 00:23:26.208

What's this all about?



281

00:23:26.208 --> 00:23:28.625

You'll see soon enough!



282

00:23:32.583 --> 00:23:34.875

In here!



283

00:23:34.875 --> 00:23:36.375

Okay.



284

00:23:39.833 --> 00:23:41.500

I brought him!



285

00:23:42.792 --> 00:23:46.875

Hey. It's been four years, Reiner.



286

00:23:52.500 --> 00:23:54.208

Eren!



287

00:23:57.333 --> 00:24:01.125

In a dusky cellar, Reiner confronts Eren.



288

00:24:01.125 --> 00:24:06.375

As the crowd is absorbed

by Willy's speech, Eren admits:



289

00:24:06.375 --> 00:24:09.458

"I'm the same as you."



290

00:24:09.458 --> 00:24:12.096

Next episode: "Declaration of War."

